<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 16:48:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>LME收紧大头寸规则以缓解铝挤压</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/lme-tightens-rules-on-big-positions-to-address-aluminum-squeeze</link><description>伦敦金属交易所采取行动解决扰乱铝市场的大规模挤压问题，瞄准了持有大量头寸的交易商。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/lme-tightens-rules-on-big-positions-to-address-aluminum-squeeze'&gt;LME收紧大头寸规则以缓解铝挤压&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：LME Tightens Rules on Big Positions to Ease Aluminum Squeeze&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/lme-tightens-rules-on-big-positions-to-address-aluminum-squeeze</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:28:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>英伟达董事会面临治理问题</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/nvidia-s-board-faces-governance-questions-video</link><description>英伟达董事会在首席执行官黄仁勋短暂离职后将其重新召回，引发了有关公司治理、国家安全和政治影响力的质疑。哈佛大学法学教授杰西·弗里德认为，董事会的决定反映了其对股东的责任，而批评者则警告说，总统的参与可能会开创一个令人不安的先例。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/nvidia-s-board-faces-governance-questions-video'&gt;英伟达董事会面临治理问题&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nvidia’s Board Faces Governance Questions&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/nvidia-s-board-faces-governance-questions-video</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 16:23:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>英伟达兴奋消退、新关税浮出水面，纳斯达克 100 指数暴跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/us-tech-stocks-poised-to-slide-as-ai-caution-returns-after-rally</link><description>周二美国股市暴跌，芯片制造商再次大幅下跌，科技股的缓解性反弹让位于对人工智能贸易持久性的新谨慎，而且美国新的关税计划重新引发了贸易担忧。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/us-tech-stocks-poised-to-slide-as-ai-caution-returns-after-rally'&gt;英伟达兴奋消退、新关税浮出水面，纳斯达克 100 指数暴跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nasdaq 100 Tumbles as Nvidia Euphoria Fades, New Tariffs Floated&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/us-tech-stocks-poised-to-slide-as-ai-caution-returns-after-rally</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 09:45:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>因技术溃败和关税担忧，铜价跌至三月以来最低水平</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/copper-resumes-decline-as-investors-look-beyond-drama-at-nvidia</link><description>由于科技巨头的抛售拖累股市和大宗商品，而白宫承诺征收新一轮关税，铜价跌至3月份以来的最低水平。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/copper-resumes-decline-as-investors-look-beyond-drama-at-nvidia'&gt;因技术溃败和关税担忧，铜价跌至三月以来最低水平&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Copper Drops to Lowest Since March on Tech Rout, Tariff Fears&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/copper-resumes-decline-as-investors-look-beyond-drama-at-nvidia</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 02:38:19 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>美国支持的石油公司签署委内瑞拉疏浚协议</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/us-backed-firm-to-ink-venezuela-dredging-deal-to-aid-oil-exports</link><description>这家美国支持的公司致力于帮助恢复委内瑞拉的石油生产，计划签署一项疏浚协议，以便更容易从该国最古老的油田中心的一个湖泊进行出口。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/us-backed-firm-to-ink-venezuela-dredging-deal-to-aid-oil-exports'&gt;美国支持的石油公司签署委内瑞拉疏浚协议&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US-Backed Oil Firm to Ink Venezuela Dredging Deal&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/us-backed-firm-to-ink-venezuela-dredging-deal-to-aid-oil-exports</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:17:54 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>顶级策略师称 Nvidia 为“纸牌屋”</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/top-strategist-calls-nvidia-a-house-of-cards-video</link><description>英伟达的反弹可能为人工智能贸易赢得了时间，但数据中心建设的推迟、对价格敏感的需求和日益严格的审查正在引发人们对未来利润的怀疑，Miller Tabak and Co.首席市场策略师兼马利报告创始人马特·马利(Matt Maley)表示。他加入了彭博未平仓合约，讨论了市场对几个关键参与者的依赖，以及为什么循环融资让该行业看起来像纸牌屋。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/top-strategist-calls-nvidia-a-house-of-cards-video'&gt;顶级策略师称 Nvidia 为“纸牌屋”&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Top Strategist Calls Nvidia a House of Cards&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/top-strategist-calls-nvidia-a-house-of-cards-video</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 16:38:14 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着股市下跌，国债上涨，避险需求复苏</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/treasuries-advance-as-cheaper-oil-alleviates-inflation-concerns</link><description>由于美国股市回吐了周一大幅上涨的部分涨幅，美国国债因避险需求而上涨，这表明投资者仍对技术投资继续推动经济增长的潜力感到不安。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/treasuries-advance-as-cheaper-oil-alleviates-inflation-concerns'&gt;随着股市下跌，国债上涨，避险需求复苏&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Treasuries Advance as Stocks Fall, Reviving Haven Demand&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/treasuries-advance-as-cheaper-oil-alleviates-inflation-concerns</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 04:42:33 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>黄仁勋复职，英伟达 (NVDA) 股价飙升，引发杠杆 ETF 争论</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-24/nvidia-nvda-surging-on-huang-s-reinstatement-brings-back-leveraged-etf-debate</link><description>英伟达股价飙升在杠杆 ETF 投资者中创造了大赢家和输家&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-24/nvidia-nvda-surging-on-huang-s-reinstatement-brings-back-leveraged-etf-debate'&gt;黄仁勋复职，英伟达 (NVDA) 股价飙升，引发杠杆 ETF 争论&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nvidia (NVDA) Surging on Huang’s Reinstatement Brings Back Leveraged ETF Debate&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-24/nvidia-nvda-surging-on-huang-s-reinstatement-brings-back-leveraged-etf-debate</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 16:42:25 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>